lines:
Steven: Hm? {0100:0}, hi.
It’s been a while.{be01}
There’s something here that you can’t
see, right?{be01}
Now, if I were to use this device on
the invisible obstacle...{be01}
No, no. Rather than describing it,
I should just show you.{be00}
That would be more fun.{be01}
{0100:0}, are your Pokémon ready for
battle?

大吾使用了得文侦测镜。{be01}
看不见的宝可梦
完全现形了！{be01}
受惊的宝可梦攻击过来了！

Steven: I see...
Your battle style is intriguing.{be01}
Your Pokémon have obviously grown
since I first met you in Dewford.{be01}
I’d like you to have this
Devon Scope.{be01}
Who knows, there may be other
concealed Pokémon.

大吾：{0100:0}，{be01}
我很喜欢看到训练家和宝可梦
共同努力一起成长，{be01}
你做得很不错。{be01}
那么，后会有期。

Give the case a shake, and out pops
a Pokéblock...{be01}
And that Pokéblock is caught and eaten
by a Pokémon...{be01}
It’s an expression of love, isn’t it?

{0100:0}使用了得文侦测镜。{be01}
看不见的宝可梦
完全现形了！{be01}
受惊的宝可梦攻击过来了！

玛莉：太棒了！太棒了！
你到底是谁？！{be01}
我就知道发现你的时候
一定会有什么惊喜！{be01}
哦，让我解释一下。我们四处旅行
采访各种各样的训练家。{be01}
那么，你愿意抽点时间
接受我们的采访吗？

Gabby: Wow, you are something!{be01}
You’ve gotten a lot stronger - a lot -
since we last battled.{be01}
We were right about you when we
spotted you as a hot Trainer.{be01}
So, anyway, what do you think?
Are you willing to give us an interview{be00}
this time?

玛莉：嗯，没错！
这句话作为结尾太完美了！{be01}
我有预感这期节目
一定会很精彩。{be01}
说不定会在电视上播出，
记得关注我们哦！{be01}
好！
下次见！
